  "description": "Boost your program with \"Swiss Army knife\" functionality covering various type conversions, utility classes, database abstraction layer, object mapping, and more.\n\nDesigned to be used anywhere whenever possible. \n\nAbove statement includes desktop applications, services, console programs running on any runtime.\n\nRuntimes .NET (2.0 + above) and .NET Core (2.0 + later) are supported. \nCF.NET support is available as separate download.\n\nBrowse project page for more details.",
